# Dack Fayden, Helping Hand entering under an opponent's control: Bot1 discards Dack to Faithless Looting and Bot2
# reanimates it, so the enters ability is Bot2's (CR 603.3a) and "you" is Bot2 (CR 109.5). Bot2's library is revealed -
# past a Forest that stays in it - and Bot2's Llanowar Elves is put onto the battlefield, goaded by Bot2 for the rest of
# the game (CR 701.15b), and given to Bot2's only opponent, Bot1 - Dack's owner. Bot1's library is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Dack Fayden, Helping Hand
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Reanimate
Island x5
Island
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Dack Fayden, Helping Hand; Island)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Dack Fayden, Helping Hand)
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Stack.Count = 0
